te hazardous environments, and compete with your friends to become the ultimate docker!\n\n\"There's no drag in space\" -- Realistic physics means that 'docking' becomes a skilful task, as you learn to master your momentum.\n\nFeatures\n- Career Mode: authored missions with unique twists to train and test your docking abilities\n- Additional Procedural Content: Weekly missions, as well as 'on-demand' random jobs\n- Race Mode: push your flying skills to the max\n- Re-bindable Virtual Cockpit Controls\n- Compete via Friends/Global Leaderboards\n- Unlockable Achievements", "short_description": "A \u201cNewtonian physics\u201d space-flight simulator for VR! \nGet in the cockpit, pilot a spacecraft, navigate hazardous environments, and compete with your friends to become the ultimate docker!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.catcommandos.com/sdvr-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Cat Commandos Ltd", "support_website_url": "https://www.catcommandos.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.catcommandos.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1017856772101593"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 15, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1329041639081554"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2472684099921668"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1370561765055